            "review_text": "Dean C\n5 contributions\n0\nSlow missing order\nSep 2026 • Solo\nOrder soup and rice together and soup arrived - waited another 30mins for rice didn’t arrive then asked waitress she said 10 more minutes then nothing then asked manager then she said order list then it arrive 5 mins later - Soup was nice..!!\nWritten September 9, 2026\nDaydream37166116430\nDear Ms/Mr. Y2237AQdeanc,\nRoyal Seafood sincerely apologize for the delay and inconvenience during your visit. Royal Seafood have taken note of your feedback and will review and improve our service process to prevent delays or missed orders in the future. Thank you very much for sharing your feedback with us, and Royal Seafood hope to have the opportunity to serve you better next time!\nTo assist us in investigating your case more efficiently, we kindly invite you to contact our Customer Service Team via our hotline at 1900 0303 or email cskh@haisanhoanggia.com. If possible, please provide your reservation phone number or a photo of your dining receipt.\nSincerely,\nRoyal Seafood\nRead more\nWritten September 12, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
